OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine day today with lighter
OL,6,Fwinds and plenty of sunny spells. The
OL,7,Fsunshine may turn hazy at times, but
OL,8,Fstaying bright and feeling warm in the
OL,9,Fsunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FStaying dry with clear spells
OL,12,Fat first tonight. Cloud will thicken
OL,13,Fin the early hours, particularly in
OL,14,Fthe north and west.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA partly cloudy day but
OL,17,Fremaining dry across Wales. Some
OL,18,Fbright spells are likely at times,
OL,19,Fparticularly in the south, and feeling
OL,20,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
